{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the first chapter of Compensation Not Guaranteed in this preview Demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get people to give up their land for the only ones who know how to use it right - The government!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/extras/ss_neighbourhood_hd.png?t=1746167548\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a seldom told story of post-colonial Southeast Asia, interpreted through a surrealist lens. Find out what sacrifices were made, so that former backwater outposts could transform into global powerhouses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/extras/ss_rosa_hd.png?t=1746167548\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ministry of Urban Development needs to acquire land from the citizens so that it can be put to better use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To do your part in the great transformation of our island nation, all you have to do is meet citizens who own the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/extras/ss_kee_hd.png?t=1746167548\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check their ownership documents, listen to their interesting backstories, and learn about their circumstances. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then decide if they are people who genuinely deserve some compensation for their troubles, or are less 'civic minded' individuals who should simply make the noble sacrifice for the greater good. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However you decide to take over their land, you will be playing a key role in ushering in a new age of prosperity and happiness for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/extras/ss_director_hd.png?t=1746167548\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Meet cast of interesting characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Face challenging but meaningful choices  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Decide who is deserving of your help </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover the in's and out's of your administrative powers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Find out how your solutions impact the people around you and beyond </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Follow the early story of a nation's growth through the decades  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600750?t=1746167548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/3f86fd3030034eaad8922eba2b5e1b7e3b5fa0f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746167548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/4f031e84e65e2ea48fddb0a9378f206b8e6ac3d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746167548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/4f031e84e65e2ea48fddb0a9378f206b8e6ac3d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746167548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the first chapter of Compensation Not Guaranteed in this preview Demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p clas