nd happiness for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/extras/ss_director_hd.png?t=1746167548\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Meet cast of interesting characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Face challenging but meaningful choices  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Decide who is deserving of your help </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover the in's and out's of your administrative powers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Find out how your solutions impact the people around you and beyond </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Follow the early story of a nation's growth through the decades  </p></li></ul>","developers":["Team Project Lunch"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2795590","name":"Compensation Not Guaranteed"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600750/ed94c819771cb78c860524cf9f4a7befabff1ce6/header.jpg?t=1746167548","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134152,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134152/movie480.mp4?t=1746167545","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134152/movie_max.mp4?t=1746167545"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134152/767f95f86655073b05dd8653cac35b585e420604/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746167545","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134152/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746167545","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134152/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746167545"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257124815,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.ste